      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What you are describing sounds like a significant shift in sensory perception. While the concept of \"neuro-evolutionary leaps\" in humans is highly theoretical, sudden, vivid changes in how you perceive energy like heat or auditory signals could be linked to various neurological factors. It might be helpful to monitor these experiences and perhaps mention them to a healthcare professional for a thorough check-up. They can help determine if this is a physical or psychological phenomenon.",
      "source": "target",
